[h2]Build 0.9.136[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]When a crafting recipe asks for "any leather", "any wood", "any fabric" or "any metal" and the item does not record which was used, repairs and recycling now count it as plain leather, wood, cloth or steel (instead of the cheapest allowed option). Items made from a recorded material still use that material.
[/list]
